	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By pulling on your opponent’s center of gravity, you launch them just as they try to drive out of your grip. When an opponent escapes your grapple, you may use a reaction to throw them 10ft, +5ft for every size category smaller than you they are, -5ft for every size category larger. The target takes Basic Melee damage and must make a Dexterity save or wind up [[/condition id=prone]].</p>",
